data: {"type":"question.verdict","questionId":"c1a58983-d1db-4def-bd4f-60600d228853","responseMode":"direct","headline":"SOC 2 및 ISO 27001 인증 보유","condition":null,"evidence":[{"id":"6b4b64bf-3c14-4e7d-9de7-13607d14deac","source_type":"release","source_url":"https://github.com/supabase/supabase/releases/tag/v1.26.05","external_ref":"v1.26.05","heading_path":"Developer Update - May 2026 > Supabase is now ISO 27001 certified","content":"Developer Update - May 2026 > Supabase is now ISO 27001 certified\n\nSupabase is certified to ISO/IEC 27001:2022, covering the information security management system across the entire platform.\n\n[[Blog](https://supabase.com/blog/supabase-is-now-iso-27001-certified)]","audience_level":"public","valid_from":"2026-05-06T15:00:00.000Z","distance":0.5907409916819366},{"id":"024eb963-244d-47d5-b5dd-81a6721ee9e5","source_type":"release","source_url":"https://github.com/supabase/supabase/releases/tag/1.25.04","external_ref":"1.25.04","heading_path":"Developer Update - April 2025 > Quick Product Announcements","content":"Developer Update - April 2025 > Quick Product Announcements\n\n- The new Supabase SOC 2 report is available. [[Link](https://supabase.com/features/soc-2-compliance)]\n- We published comprehensive documentation about our security processes and controls. [[Docs](https://supabase.link/docs-security-docs-overview-apr2025-5xpu)]","audience_level":"public","valid_from":"2025-05-06T15:00:00.000Z","distance":0.6005229460146244},{"id":"19d11ebb-3217-4206-9b2b-4e3a0b1aebf5","source_type":"merged_pr","source_url":"https://github.com/supabase/supabase/pull/33965","external_ref":"#33965","heading_path":"feat: SOC 2 docs page > Additional context","content":"feat: SOC 2 docs page > Additional context\n\nIntroduces SOC 2 documentation and the start of guides to compliance.","audience_level":"public","valid_from":"2026-09-07T15:00:00.000Z","distance":0.6079108468107144}],"latencyMs":1661}

