data: {"type":"question.verdict","questionId":"4f032355-d395-475d-a072-c644c6d45adf","responseMode":"escalate","headline":"일정 확인 필요 · Edge Functions는 셀프호스팅에서 언제 지원되나요?","condition":null,"evidence":[{"id":"cfd815c1-da18-422f-a99c-11c79e2a5c26","source_type":"release","source_url":"https://github.com/supabase/supabase/releases/tag/v1.26.03","external_ref":"v1.26.03","heading_path":"Developer Update - March 2026 > Edge Functions dashboard for self-hosted and CLI","content":"Developer Update - March 2026 > Edge Functions dashboard for self-hosted and CLI\n\nList and search your functions, view details, test directly from the dashboard, and download as `.zip`. No longer cloud-only.\n\n[Twitter](https://x.com/kiwicopple/status/2026264137505087826)","audience_level":"public","valid_from":"2026-03-04T15:00:00.000Z","distance":0.548251913907304},{"id":"ce19f665-e9b2-4318-b4ee-748807eac680","source_type":"release","source_url":"https://github.com/supabase/supabase/releases/tag/1.25.03","external_ref":"1.25.03","heading_path":"Developer Update - March 2025 > Edge Functions Deploy from the Supabase Dashboard","content":"Developer Update - March 2025 > Edge Functions Deploy from the Supabase Dashboard\n\nYou can now create, test, edit, and deploy Supabase Edge Functions directly from the Supabase Dashboard.\n\n[[Link](https://supabase.link/link-edge-functions-deploy-dashboard-mar2025-8ttw)]","audience_level":"public","valid_from":"2025-04-07T15:00:00.000Z","distance":0.6044607918321735},{"id":"8e120d4c-e97c-4f14-a386-b00be5de8d74","source_type":"release","source_url":"https://github.com/supabase/supabase/releases/tag/1.25.04","external_ref":"1.25.04","heading_path":"Developer Update - April 2025 > MCP Server can now create and deploy Edge Functions","content":"Developer Update - April 2025 > MCP Server can now create and deploy Edge Functions\n\nUse the Supabase MCP server to build Edge Functions.\n\n[[Twitter](https://supabase.link/twitter-mcp-edge-functions-deploy-apr2025-az9v)]","audience_level":"public","valid_from":"2025-05-06T15:00:00.000Z","distance":0.6123504862059983}],"latencyMs":426}

